</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Mean squared error (MSE) of regression, IPW, and DR Estimators under potential nuisance misspecification with sample size <math id="A5.T1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=10000,n_{g}=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=10000,n_{g}=100</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
