</figure>
<div id="A5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The conclusions in this clustered setting are similar to those in the classical i.i.d. setting. When the outcome model <math id="A5.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math> is misspecified, the plug-in (regression) estimator <math id="A5.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{\text{OR}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>OR</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{\text{OR}}</annotation></semantics></math> becomes inconsistent. Similarly, the consistency of the IPW estimator <math id="A5.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{\text{IPW}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>IPW</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{\text{IPW}}</annotation></semantics></math> relies on correct specification of the propensity score <math id="A5.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math>. In contrast, the doubly robust estimator <math id="A5.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{\text{DR}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>DR</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{\text{DR}}</annotation></semantics></math>, which models both the outcome and the missingness mechanism, remains consistent as long as either <math id="A5.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math> or <math id="A5.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math> is correctly specified. This aligns with the theoretical guarantees established in Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 3.1 Doubly Robust Estimation ‣ 3 Clustered Missing Data under Homogeneous Sampling ‣ Handling Missing Responses under Cluster Dependence with Applications to Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 3.1 Doubly Robust Estimation ‣ 3 Clustered Missing Data under Homogeneous Sampling ‣ Handling Missing Responses under Cluster Dependence with Applications to Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since the observations <math id="A6.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{\mathbf{O}_{gi},1\leq i\leq n_{g},1\leq g\leq G\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathbf{O}_{gi},1\leq i\leq n_{g},1\leq g\leq G\}</annotation></semantics></math> share the same distribution, we have the following decomposition of error</p>
<table id="A6.Ex40" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A6.Ex40X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex40X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\widehat{\theta}_{DR}-\theta=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\widehat{\theta}_{DR}-\theta=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex40X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex40Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex40Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>G</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msup><mo>(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex40Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex40Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where for a potentially random function <math id="A6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> of <math id="A6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{O}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐎</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{O}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}[f(\mathbf{O})]=\int f(\boldsymbol{o})d\mathbb{P}(\boldsymbol{o})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>ℙ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}[f(\mathbf{O})]=\int f(\boldsymbol{o})d\mathbb{P}(\boldsymbol{o})</annotation></semantics></math> so only the randomness of <math id="A6.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{O}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐎</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{O}</annotation></semantics></math> is averaged over.
For the first CLT term, by the central limit theorem for clustered data <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hansen and Lee,, 2019</a>)</cite>[Theorem 2], under the assumptions in our Theorem 1 we have</p>
<table id="A6.Ex41" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{\frac{n}{\Omega_{n}}}\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)\stackrel{{\scriptstyle d}}{{\rightarrow}}N(0,1)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mi>n</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mover><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>d</mi></mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{\frac{n}{\Omega_{n}}}\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)\stackrel{{\scriptstyle d}}{{\rightarrow}}N(0,1),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.3" class="ltx_p">and thus the order is</p>
<table id="A6.Ex42" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)=O_{\mathbb{P}}\left(\sqrt{\frac{\Omega_{n}}{n}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)=O_{\mathbb{P}}\left(\sqrt{\frac{\Omega_{n}}{n}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.4" class="ltx_p">For the second empirical process term, by Markov’s inequality, we have (conditioning on <math id="A6.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> that is used to estimate the nuisance functions)</p>
<table id="A6.Ex43" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A6.Ex43X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex43X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)&gt;t\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)&gt;t\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex43Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex43Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex43Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}{n^{2}t^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}{n^{2}t^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex43Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex43Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex43Xb.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}{n^{2}t^{2}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}{n^{2}t^{2}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.5" class="ltx_p">where the last equation follows from the independence of observations that come from different clusters. Set</p>
<table id="A6.Ex44" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\frac{M\sqrt{\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}}{n}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\frac{M\sqrt{\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}}{n},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.6" class="ltx_p">we have</p>
<table id="A6.Ex45" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A6.Ex45X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex45X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)&gt;t\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{P}\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)&gt;t\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex45Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex45Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{1}{M^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.448em">≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{1}{M^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.7" class="ltx_p">Thus the empirical process term can be bounded as</p>
<table id="A6.Ex46" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A6.Ex46X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex46X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-\varphi(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex46Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex46Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex46Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle O_{\mathbb{P}}\left(\frac{\sqrt{\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}}{n}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle O_{\mathbb{P}}\left(\frac{\sqrt{\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)}}{n}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.8" class="ltx_p">For the third bias term, by the property of conditional expectation we have</p>
<table id="A6.Ex47" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A6.Ex47X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex47X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex47Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex47Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex47Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{R_{gi}(Y_{gi}-\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))}{\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})}+\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{R_{gi}(Y_{gi}-\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))}{\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})}+\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex47Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex47Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex47Xb.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{\pi(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})({\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))}{\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})}+\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{\pi(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})({\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))}{\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})}+\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex47Xc"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex47Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex47Xc.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{(\pi(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))({\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))}{\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})}\right]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{(\pi(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))({\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})-\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi}))}{\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{gi})}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.9" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A6.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\pi}\geq\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>≥</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\pi}\geq\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math> and by Cauchy Schwarz inequality, we have</p>
<table id="A6.Ex48" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]|\leq\frac{1}{\epsilon}\|\widehat{\pi}-\pi\|\|\widehat{\mu}-\mu\|," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ϵ</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]|\leq\frac{1}{\epsilon}\|\widehat{\pi}-\pi\|\|\widehat{\mu}-\mu\|,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.10" class="ltx_p">which implies</p>
<table id="A6.Ex49" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]|=O_{\mathbb{P}}(\|\widehat{\pi}-\pi\|\|\widehat{\mu}-\mu\|)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})]|=O_{\mathbb{P}}(\|\widehat{\pi}-\pi\|\|\widehat{\mu}-\mu\|).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p1.11" class="ltx_p">This completes the proof of the asymptotic expansion. The asymptotic normality then follows from Slutsky’s theorem.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Proof of Corollary <a href="#Thmcorollary1" title="Corollary 1. ‣ 3.1 Doubly Robust Estimation ‣ 3 Clustered Missing Data under Homogeneous Sampling ‣ Handling Missing Responses under Cluster Dependence with Applications to Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The conditional variance given the training set <math id="A7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> can be expressed as</p>
<table id="A7.Ex50" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A7.Ex50X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}))\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A7.Ex50Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\operatorname{Cov}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}),\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gj})\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\operatorname{Cov}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi}),\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gj})\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A7.Ex50Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xb.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O}_{gi})\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A7.Ex50Xc"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xc.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}n_{g}^{2}\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O})\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}n_{g}^{2}\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{O})\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A7.Ex50Xd"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex50Xd.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}n_{g}^{2}\|\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O})-\varphi(\mathbf{O})\|^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐎</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}n_{g}^{2}\|\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{O})-\varphi(\mathbf{O})\|^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A7.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where we have used Cauchy Schwarz inequality to bound the covariance with variance and the fact that the observations <math id="A7.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{\mathbf{O}_{gi},1\leq i\leq n_{g},1\leq g\leq G\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>𝐎</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathbf{O}_{gi},1\leq i\leq n_{g},1\leq g\leq G\}</annotation></semantics></math> are identically distributed.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem 2. ‣ 4 Clustered Missing Data under Sequential Sampling ‣ Handling Missing Responses under Cluster Dependence with Applications to Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a></h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.2" class="ltx_p">We have the following error decomposition</p>
<table id="A8.Ex51" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A8.Ex51X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex51X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\widehat{\psi}_{DR}-\psi_{n}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ψ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\widehat{\psi}_{DR}-\psi_{n}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex51X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\mathbb{E}[\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A8.Ex51Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex51Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>G</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msup><mo>(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A8.Ex51Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex51Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>G</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msup><mi>ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A8.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where note that <math id="A8.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{\mathbf{Z}_{gt},1\leq t\leq n_{g},1\leq g\leq G,\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathbf{Z}_{gt},1\leq t\leq n_{g},1\leq g\leq G,\}</annotation></semantics></math> may not share the same distribution in general. The empirical process can be bounded using the same technique as in the proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 3.1 Doubly Robust Estimation ‣ 3 Clustered Missing Data under Homogeneous Sampling ‣ Handling Missing Responses under Cluster Dependence with Applications to Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A8.Ex52" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A8.Ex52X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex52X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-\varphi(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
