<p id="A8.p1.5" class="ltx_p">where the second equation follows from conditioning on <math id="A8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{H}_{gt})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐇</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{H}_{gt})</annotation></semantics></math> and the third equation follows from Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption3" title="Assumption 3. ‣ 4 Clustered Missing Data under Sequential Sampling ‣ Handling Missing Responses under Cluster Dependence with Applications to Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. Hence we have</p>
<table id="A8.E7" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A8.E7X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.E7X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left|\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left|\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})]\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.E7Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.E7Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.E7Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{\epsilon n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\|\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|\|\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{\epsilon n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\|\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|\|\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A8.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Thus the conditional bias term can be bounded as</p>
<table id="A8.Ex54" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A8.Ex54X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex54X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0.170em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\mathbb{P}[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gt})])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A8.Ex54Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex54Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A8.Ex54Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle O_{\mathbb{P}}\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\|\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|\|\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle O_{\mathbb{P}}\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{t=1}^{n_{g}}\|\widehat{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\pi}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|\|\widehat{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})-{\mu}(\mathbf{X}_{g},\mathbf{S}_{gt})\|\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A8.p2.2" class="ltx_p">The asymptotic expansion is then proved. The asymptotic normality then follows from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hansen and Lee, (2019)</a></cite>[Theorem 2] and Slutsky’s theorem.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>Proof of Corollary <a href="#Thmcorollary2" title="Corollary 2. ‣ 4 Clustered Missing Data under Sequential Sampling ‣ Handling Missing Responses under Cluster Dependence with Applications to Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a></h2>

<div id="A9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">First, to bound the empirical process term, the conditional variance given the training set <math id="A9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> can be expressed as</p>
<table id="A9.Ex55" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A9.Ex55X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex55X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}))\mid D\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}))\mid D\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A9.Ex55Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex55Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex55Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\operatorname{Cov}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}),\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})\mid D\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\operatorname{Cov}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}),\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})\mid D\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A9.Ex55Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex55Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex55Xb.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\sqrt{\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})\mid D\right)\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})\mid D\right)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Var</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\sqrt{\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})\mid D\right)\operatorname{Var}\left(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})\mid D\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A9.Ex55Xc"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex55Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex55Xc.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\sqrt{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gi}}\left[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})^{2}\right]\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gj}}\left[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})^{2}\right]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\sqrt{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gi}}\left[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})^{2}\right]\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gj}}\left[\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})^{2}\right]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A9.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where we have used Cauchy Schwarz inequality to bound the covariance with variance and <math id="A9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gi}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gi}}</annotation></semantics></math> means the expectation is taken over <math id="A9.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}_{gi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}_{gi}</annotation></semantics></math>. Now we have</p>
<table id="A9.Ex56" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A9.Ex56X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex56X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{D}\left[\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}))\mid D\right)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{D}\left[\sum_{g=1}^{G}\operatorname{Var}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n_{g}}(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}))\mid D\right)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A9.Ex56Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex56Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex56Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\mathbb{E}_{D}\left[\sqrt{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gi}}\left[(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}))^{2}\right]\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gj}}\left[(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj}))^{2}\right]}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>φ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{g=1}^{G}\sum_{i,j}\mathbb{E}_{D}\left[\sqrt{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gi}}\left[(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gi}))^{2}\right]\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{Z}_{gj}}\left[(\widehat{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj})-{\varphi}(\mathbf{Z}_{gj}))^{2}\right]}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
